text = "Move: WASD / Left Stick
Orbit: Mouse / Right Stick
Jump: Space / A  (hold for height, wall-jump, ledge-grab)
Dash: Shift / B / R1
Quality: F1   •   Hide Help: H   •   Cursor: Esc"

